1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,260
I have failed to protect the mark.

2
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,540
It is completely broken.

3
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:19,910
Stand strong, Ink Knight.

4
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:21,450
Never yield.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,060
Only all six mediums forged into one unified tool
can halt the grid.

6
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,770
I'll stitch this split in no time.

7
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,810
Threads of gold, hold tight.

8
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:55,090
Together we are unbroken.

9
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:17,160
Only those who honor the Maker's hand
may cross this threshold.
